    rdfs:comment "Specification-level task corresponding to the Traffic Control PBL case. It represents the computational problem to be addressed, namely the design of a formal solution capable of processing traffic data, classifying vehicles into weight-based categories, counting category frequencies, and identifying the most frequent category."@en ;
